E351                             ; `$ (never checked: the spec says so)
E351   20 37 E5     G_HEX:    JSR   rdhex   
E354   B0 14                  BCS   hx2   
E356   0A                     ASL      
E357   0A                     ASL      
E358   0A                     ASL      
E359   0A                     ASL      
E35A   85 04                  STA   T0   
E35C   20 37 E5               JSR   rdhex   
